{"name":"28-Hour Day","dev":"Rynak Iqbal","keys":["ios:6752815000"],"ios":{"id":"6752815000","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/28-hour-day/id6752815000?uo=4","rating":0,"ratings":0,"price":"Free","genre":"Utilities","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/d7/b4/a4/d7b4a4e1-297a-4993-5684-070b1f499475/iPhone_6.5_-_1__U00284_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/53/c1/90/53c1904b-0c77-fefc-3543-aaebd44c87f3/iPhone_6.5_-_2__U00288_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/f4/6b/3d/f46b3d7d-f4d9-3b6a-7314-833ba3e3c9a1/iPhone_6.5_-_3__U00286_U0029.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"28-Hour Day lets you experience longer days while keeping the length of your weeks the same. Each week now has 6 days instead of 7, with the start of the week corresponding to a day of your choosing.\n\nWith 28-Hour Day, you can:\n\n• View the time in a 28-hour format, always synced to your local time zone.\n• Track which day it is in your 6-day week.\n• Set, edit, and manage alarms designed for 28-hour days.\n\nWhether you're experimenting with alternative schedules or just want a fresh perspective on your routine, 28-Hour Day makes it easy to live outside the 24-hour box.","released":"2025-09-21","updated":"2026-07-06","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/47/fc/3e/47fc3ee4-1cbc-db28-9a36-6e83afde84c8/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007ephone-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/47/fc/3e/47fc3ee4-1cbc-db28-9a36-6e83afde84c8/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007ephone-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Utilities","rating":null,"ratings":0,"mentions":3,"users":1,"threads":3,"hn_points":6,"hn_comments":2,"submissions":3,"self_n":3,"hn_score":5.91,"first":1783640182,"last":1789311669,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":0,"pos_pct":null,"neg_pct":null,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":48853874,"k":"ios:6752815000","type":"st